    {
      "id": "1024448",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Scope of Work:\r\nCrews will replace and upgrade the track area at Chinatown while also upgrading signals at Wellington and North Station which will strengthen service reliability.\r\n\r\nLocal Shuttle Service:\r\nFree and accessible shuttle buses will service all stations between Oak Grove and North Station. \r\n\r\nExpress Shuttle Service:\r\nFree and accessible shuttles will service Oak Grove, Malden Center, Wellington, and North Station.\r\n\r\nAccessible Vans:\r\nAccessible vans will be available at all Orange Line stations between Back Bay and Oak Grove, as well as Copley on the Green Line. See station personnel for assistance.\r\n\r\nTravel Times:\r\nRiders using the shuttles should budget extra travel time. For example, a rider traveling to Downtown Crossing from Oak Grove should budget at least an additional 70 minutes of travel time in addition to their regular commute.  \r\n\r\nCommuter Rail Alternates:\r\nRiders are encouraged to consider the Haverhill Commuter Rail Line for fare-free service to and from Oak Grove, Malden Center, and North Station. Regular fares should be purchased beyond Oak Grove.\r\n\r\nShuttle Bus Locations:\r\n\r\nOak Grove:\r\nOak Grove Busway\r\n\r\nMalden Center:\r\nNorthbound - West Busway, Berth A3\u200b\r\nSouthbound - East Busway, Berth B1\r\n\r\nWellington:\r\nWellington Busway\r\n\r\nAssembly:\r\nGrand Union Blvd @ Foley St (Route 90 Bus Stops)\r\n\r\nSullivan Square:\r\nNorthbound - Upper Busway, Berth A2\u200b\r\nSouthbound - Upper Busway, Berth A5\u200b\r\n\r\nCommunity College:\r\nNew Rutherford Ave @ Austin St\r\n\r\nNorth Station:\r\nHaverhill St @ Causeway St\r\n\r\nAfter North Station:\r\nPassengers can use the Green Line between North Station and Copley/Back Bay. \r\n\r\nhttps://platform.remix.com/project/2acd9801\r\n\r\nAdd This To Your Calendar:\r\nhttps://calendarlink.com/event/XBw9I\r\n",
      "severity": 7,
      "route_id": "unknown"
    },
